title: 'pallet-revive: recalibrate `contains_storage` benchmark'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: The `contains_storage` benchmark now exercises the persistent storage
    path, matching how `WeightInfo::contains_storage` is dispatched from the precompile.
    The transient path remains benchmarked separately as `seal_contains_transient_storage`.
